page]:underline underline-offset-4 group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small nav-phone whitespace-nowrap max-[1021px]:hidden max-mobile:block group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:hidden" href="tel:+13213239776">Call (321) 323-9776</a> <a href="/quote/?service=deep" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-sea-dark text-white shadow-[0_8px_22px_rgba(0,101,145,.16)] hover:bg-teal active:bg-teal min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-nav font-extrabold group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small max-mobile:w-full group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:px-3">Get a Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <script type="module">const t=document.querySelector(".mobile-toggle"),n=document.querySelector("#nav-links");t?.addEventListener("click",()=>{const s=n?.classList.toggle("open")??!1;t.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(s))});document.addEventListener("click",s=>{const e=s.target;if(!(e instanceof Node))return;const o=document.querySelector(".nav-services");o?.open&&!o.contains(e)&&(o.open=!1),n?.classList.contains("open")&&!n.contains(e)&&!t?.contains(e)&&(n.classList.remove("open"),t?.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"))});document.addEventListener("keydown",s=>{if(s.key!=="Escape")return;const e=document.querySelector(".nav-services");e?.open?(e.open=!1,e.querySelector("summary")?.focus()):n?.classList.contains("open")&&(n.classList.remove("open"),t?.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"),t instanceof HTMLElement&&t.focus())});</script> <main id="main-content" class="scroll-mt-20" tabindex="-1"> <section class="bg-mist pt-12 pb-14 max-mobile:pt-7 max-mobile:pb-9" aria-labelledby="deep-hero-title"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[.92fr_1.08fr] items-center gap-14 max-tablet:gap-8 max-mobile:grid-cols-1 max-mobile:gap-7"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"> <span class="h-px w-10 shrink-0 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span> Deep cleaning </p> <h1 id="deep-hero-title" class="max-w-[700px] text-[clamp(2.7rem,4.5vw,4rem)] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-.03em] max-mobile:text-[2.65rem]">When a regular clean isn’t enough.</h1> <p class="mt-6 max-w-[620px] text-lede leading-[1.6] max-mobile:mt-4">A more detailed clean for buildup and the areas routine cleaning doesn’t spend as much time on, including baseboards, trim, fixtures, and other reachable detail work.</p> <p class="mt-5 text-[1.2rem] font-bold text-sea-dark">From $275 per visit</p> <p class="mt-2 max-w-[620px] text-small">Starting prices give you a ballpark. We’ll confirm the actual price before you book based on the property, its condition, cleaning frequency, and any extras you want.</p> <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-control-gap"> <a href="/quote/?service=deep" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-sea-dark text-white shadow-[0_8px_22px_rgba(0,101,145,.16)] hover:bg-teal active:bg-teal min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Get a Quote<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> <a class="text-small font-[750] text-sea-dark underline" href="tel:+13213239776">Call (321) 323-9776</a> </div> </div> <figure class="m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-panel bg-white shadow-[0_18px_55px_rgba(28,65,91,.09)]"> <img src="/images/deep-cleaning-kitchen.jpg" alt="Gloved hand wiping a kitchen stovetop" class="aspect-[1.12] w-full object-cover object-center max-mobile:aspect-[1.48]" width="1200" height="800" fetchpriority="high"> </figure> </div> </section>   <section class="py-[74px] max-mobile:py-14" aria-labelledby="difference-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] gap-14 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-6"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"> <span class="h-px w-10 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>
Standard vs. deep
</p> <h2 id="difference-heading" class="max-w-[500px]">What’s the difference between standard and deep cleaning?</h2> </div> <p class="max-w-[760px] text-[1.08rem] leading-[1.72]">Choose routine upkeep or extra attention to buildup. Both cover the main rooms in your home.</p> </div> <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 border-y border-line max-mobile:grid-cols-1"> <article class="py-7 pr-10 max-mobile:border-b max-mobile:border-line max-mobile:pr-0"> <p class="mb-2 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.11em] text-ink-soft">Standard home cleaning</p> <h3 class="text-[1.38rem]">For routine upkeep</h3> <p class="mt-3 max-w-[520px] text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">Kitchen and bathroom surfaces, reachable dusting, floors, and trash.</p> <a class="mt-4 inline-flex font-[750] text-sea-dark underline underline-offset-4" href="/residential-cleaning/">See Home Cleaning</a> </article> <article class="border-l border-line py-7 pl-10 max-mobile:border-l-0 max-mobile:pl-0"> <p class="mb-2 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.11em] text-teal">Deep cleaning</p> <h3 class="text-[1.38rem]">For buildup and detail work</h3> <p class="mt-3 max-w-[520px] text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">Everything in a standard clean, plus buildup, baseboards, trim, and other detailed areas.</p> </article> </div> <p class="mt-5 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]"><strong>Quoted separately:</strong> Appliance interiors, cabinet interiors, and interior window glass. These are optional with either service.</p> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-line py-[74px] max-mobile:py-14" aria-labelledby="detail-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[.78fr_1.22fr] gap-16 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-8"> <div class="border-l-4 border-teal bg-seafoam px-8 py-9 max-mobile:px-6 max-mobile:py-7"> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"> <span class="h-px w-10 bg-teal" aria-hidden="true"></span>
Service scope
</p> <h2 id="detail-heading" class="max-w-[520px]">Where a deep clean goes further.</h2> <p class="mt-5 max-w-[500px] text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.68]">A good fit when the house has fallen behind, hasn’t had a thorough cleaning in a while, or needs extra attention before guests arrive. Tell us where the trouble spots are and we’ll quote the work accordingly.</p> </div> <div class="border-y border-line/90"> <div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58] font-bold text-ink">Everything included in standard home cleaning</p> </div><div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Extra attention to buildup on accessible surfaces</p> </div><div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Baseboards, reachable trim, doors, frames, and fixtures</p> </div><div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Ceiling fans, reachable light fixtures, vent covers, switches, and door handles</p> </div><div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Window sills and tracks, plus dusting of blinds</p> </div><div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Detailed scrubbing of kitchen and bathroom surfaces, including grout where accessible</p> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="py-[74px] max-mobile:py-10" aria-labelledby="pricing-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[.85fr_1.15fr] gap-16 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-8"> <div> <p class="mb-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark">Quote factors</p> <h2 id="pricing-heading" class="max-w-[470px]">What affects the quote.</h2> <p class="mt-5 max-w-[540px] text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.68]">Your quote depends on property size, current condition, and the amount of detail work required. Appliance interiors, cabinet interiors, and interior window glass are optional and quoted separately.</p> </div> <ul class="m-0 mt-5 grid list-none grid-cols-2 gap-x-5 border-t border-line p-0 self-start" role="list"> <li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Square footage</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Bedrooms &amp; bathrooms</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Condition &amp; buildup</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Requested detail work</li> </ul> </div> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-line py-[74px] max-mobile:py-10" aria-labelledby="extras-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[1.08fr_.92fr] items-center gap-14 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-8"> <figure class="m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-panel bg-mist"> <img src="/images/cleaner-refrigerator.webp" alt="Man wiping the inside of a refrigerator" class="aspect-[1.42] w-full object-cover object-[70%_center] max-mobile:aspect-[1.5]" width="1280" height="853" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="border-t border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink-soft">Refrigerator interiors are an optional add-on, quoted separately.</figcaption> </figure> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"> <span class="h-px w-10 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>
Available extras
</p> <h2 id="extras-heading">Optional interior work.</h2> <p class="mt-4 max-w-[560px] text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.68]">The deep clean covers more detail on accessible surfaces. If you also want these interior tasks handled, add them to the quote:</p> <div class="mt-7 border-y border-line"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[34px_1fr] items-start border-b border-line py-4 last:border-b-0"> <span class="font-black text-sea-dark" aria-hidden="true">+</span> <p class="font-[700] text-ink">Oven and refrigerator interior detailing</p> </div><div class="grid grid-cols-[34px_1fr] items-start border-b border-line py-4 last:border-b-0"> <span class="font-black text-sea-dark" aria-hidden="true">+</span> <p class="font-[700] text-ink">Cabinet interiors</p> </div><div class="grid grid-cols-[34px_1fr] items-start border-b border-line py-4 last:border-b-0"> <span class="font-black text-sea-dark" aria-hidden="true">+</span> <p class="font-[700] text-ink">Interior window glass</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="py-[74px] max-mobile:py-10" aria-labelledby="faq-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[.65fr_1.35fr] gap-14 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-6"> <div> <p class="mb-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark">Questions</p> <h2 id="faq-heading">Service FAQs</h2> </div> <div class="grid content-start gap-3"> <details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">How long does a deep clean take?</summary> <p class="mt-3">It depends on the size of the property, the amount of buildup, and what we agree to clean. We can give you a better idea once we know the condition and scope.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">Do I need to supply the equipment?</summary> <p class="mt-3">We bring standard cleaning supplies and equipment. Let us know in advance about delicate surfaces or any products you want us to avoid or use.</p> </details> </div> </div> </section><section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-ocean text-white py-[66px] max-mobile:py-12"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center max-tablet:grid-cols-1 gap-10"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-cyan"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-cyan" aria-hidden="true"></span>Next step</p> <h2 class="max-w-[720px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-.035em] text-white text-[clamp(2.25rem,4.2vw,3.8rem)]">Need a cleaner?</h2> <p class="mt-4 max-w-[680px] text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.65] text-white/70">Tell us what you need cleaned and when you need it. We’ll work through the details with you and confirm the price before anything is booked.</p> </div> <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 max-mobile:w-full max-mobile:[&>*]:grow"> <a href="/quote/?service=deep" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-white text-sea-dark hover:bg-mist active:bg-seafoam min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Get a Quote<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> <a href="tel:+13213239776" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-[1.5px] border-white/70 bg-transparent text-white hover:border-white hover:bg-white/15 active:bg-white/25 min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Call (321) 323-9776</a> </div> </div> </section>  </main> <footer class="footer bg-footer pt-7 pb-5 text-white group-[.island-home]/site:bg-footer max-mobile:pt-6 max-mobile:pb-[calc(64px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] group-[.no-mobile-bar]/site:max-mobile:pb-[max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))]"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[1.3fr_.7fr_.7fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-5 max-mobile:grid-cols-2 max-mobile:gap-x-5"> <div class="max-mobile:col-span-2"> <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap font-black tracking-[-.03em] text-mist no-underline group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text" href="/"> <span class="brand-mark relative size-[38px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[50%_50%_46%_54%] bg-sea-dark group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:size-8" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="grid leading-none"> <span>Beachline Cleaners</span> <span class="mt-1.5 text-[.64rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-cyan">Home &amp; Property Cleaning</span> </span> </a> <p class="mt-3 max-w-[430px] text-mist group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text max-mobile:hidden">Local cleaning for homes, moves, vacation rentals, and workspaces across the Space Coast.</p> <div class="mt-3 flex gap-4 font-extrabold text-mist group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text"> <a class="flex min-h-11 items-center no-underline" href="tel:+13213239776">(321) 323-9776</a> </div> </div> <div> <strong>Services</strong> <div class="mt-3 grid gap-0.5 text-mist group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text"> <a class="